  - `2.16.1` Vectors in $\mathbb{R}^n$: direction, magnitude, geometric displacement, and coordinate bases.
  - `2.16.2` Vector Norms: $L_1$ (Manhattan norm), $L_2$ (Euclidean norm), $L_p$ generalized norm, $L_\infty$ (Chebyshev norm).
