  - `2.20.2` Invertibility criteria: $A$ is invertible $\iff \det(A) 
eq 0 \iff 	ext{rank}(A) = n \iff 	ext{nullity}(A) = 0$.
  - `2.20.3` The Determinant: geometric scaling factor of signed area/volume under linear transformation.
