VALUES ('5022ee93-6a66-5e64-abfa-b07b83bba858', 'phase-05-lesson-40-grpc-health-checking-protocol-kubernetes-', 5, 40, 'gRPC Health Checking Protocol & Kubernetes Integration', '- **Status**: `[State: Active | Complete Specification | Core]`
- **Prerequisites**: Phase 4 (Lesson 4.29)
