VALUES ('ee24f771-65b5-54e6-a0e0-667dd23da6bc', 'phase-14-lesson-07-enterprise-capstone-vii-automated-testing', 14, 7, 'Enterprise Capstone VII: Automated Testing, Vitest & Playwright E2E', '- **Status**: `[State: Active | Complete Specification | Core]`
- **Prerequisites**: Phase 1, Phase 5, Phase 6
- **Subtopics**:
  - `14.7.1` Comprehensive testing pyramid: Unit tests ($>80\%$ coverage), Integration tests, and End-to-End (E2E) test suites
